{"seq":59,"slug":"information-retrieval-fundamentals","title":"信息检索基础","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"信息检索基础-information-retrieval-fundamentals\">信息检索基础 (Information Retrieval Fundamentals)</h1><blockquote>\n<p><strong>Family A — 技术概念型 | 受众：中级程序员（3-7 年经验）</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>信息检索（Information Retrieval，IR）是计算机科学中研究如何从大规模文档集合中找到用户需要的相关信息的学科。搜索引擎、文档检索系统、问答系统都建立在 IR 理论之上。本 hub 系统讲解 IR 的经典理论模型、核心数据结构、关键排序算法以及评测体系，是理解现代搜索系统底层机制的必要基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-覆盖范围\">本 Hub 覆盖范围</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"信息检索基础&#10;├── 1_foundations/    — IR 经典模型 + 倒排索引 + 文本预处理&#10;├── 2_ranking/        — BM25/TF-IDF + Learning to Rank + 神经排序&#10;├── 3_systems/        — 搜索引擎架构 + 分布式检索 + 查询处理&#10;└── 4_evaluation/     — 离线评测指标 + 在线评测 + 相关性标注\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>信息检索基础</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 1_foundations/    — IR 经典模型 + 倒排索引 + 文本预处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 2_ranking/        — BM25/TF-IDF + Learning to Rank + 神经排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 3_systems/        — 搜索引擎架构 + 分布式检索 + 查询处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 4_evaluation/     — 离线评测指标 + 在线评测 + 相关性标注</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本 hub 共 4 章 12 篇正文文档，覆盖从理论模型到工程落地的完整知识链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的边界\">与相邻 Hub 的边界</h2><p>本 hub 专注<strong>IR 经典理论与系统工程基础</strong>，与以下相邻 hub 互不重叠：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>00_cs-fundamentals/19_information-retrieval</code>（CS 基础概论）</td>\n<td>IR 概念的宽泛入门，算法导论级介绍</td>\n<td>本 hub 深入工程实现，公式推导，系统架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>24_ecommerce/25_ecommerce-search-ranking</code>（电商垂搜应用）</td>\n<td>电商场景的搜索排序，商业目标导向</td>\n<td>本 hub 是通用 IR 理论，不绑定垂直场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>02_ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval</code>（AI 检索系统）</td>\n<td>RAG、向量检索、神经网络检索的前沿应用</td>\n<td>本 hub 偏经典模型，神经排序仅覆盖 BERT/ColBERT 基础</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径建议\">学习路径建议</h2><p><strong>新手路线</strong>：IR 经典模型 → 倒排索引 → 文本预处理 → BM25 → 搜索引擎架构 → 离线评测指标</p>\n<p><strong>工程师路线</strong>：倒排索引（重点看压缩与合并）→ 查询处理 → 分布式检索 → 在线评测</p>\n<p><strong>算法工程师路线</strong>：BM25 → Learning to Rank → 神经排序模型 → 相关性标注 → 离线评测指标</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><code>02_ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval</code> — 向量检索与 RAG 架构的现代实践</li>\n<li><code>24_ecommerce/25_ecommerce-search-ranking</code> — 电商搜索排序的完整工程体系</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"第一章：IR 基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-classic-models","title":"IR 经典模型概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/ir-classic-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inverted-index","title":"倒排索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/inverted-index"},{"seq":3,"slug":"text-preprocessing","title":"文本预处理管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/text-preprocessing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ranking","title":"第二章：排序模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bm25-tfidf","title":"BM25 与 TF-IDF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/bm25-tfidf"},{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-to-rank","title":"排序学习 (Learning to Rank)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/learning-to-rank"},{"seq":3,"slug":"neural-ranking","title":"神经排序模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/neural-ranking"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"第三章：搜索系统工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"search-engine-architecture","title":"搜索引擎核心架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/search-engine-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-retrieval","title":"分布式检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/distributed-retrieval"},{"seq":3,"slug":"query-processing","title":"查询处理与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/query-processing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation","title":"第四章：搜索质量评测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"offline-evaluation-metrics","title":"离线评测指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation/offline-evaluation-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"online-evaluation","title":"在线评测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation/online-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"relevance-judgment","title":"相关性标注体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation/relevance-judgment"}]}]}